r ucciso l'Idra a sette teste, Giasone condurrà Medea con sé sulla via del ritorno.Liberamente ispirato al mito di Giasone, il film bada al sodo: quant'è bella l'avventura. Un capolavoro gli \"ingenui\" effetti speciali di Ray Harryhausen (con la lotta contro gli scheletri), una delizia la fotografia. Musiche di Bernard Herrmann. Un piccolo classico che vanta numerosi cultori.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"The epic story that was destined to stand as a colossus of adventure!","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"1963-06-13","status":"Released","rating":7.173,"ratingCount":732,"genres":["Avventura","Famiglia","Fantasy"],"countries":["United States of America","United Kingdom"],"facts":{"Runtime":"104m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":40241,"name":"Todd Armstrong","role":"Jason","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4f0A4Ia62nH9TCCYwh0k2aWP6Rl.jpg"},{"id":69763,"name":"Nancy Kovack","role":"Medea","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v8dMVo6jjfjGBOHSAzhJtopgqYZ.jpg"},{"id":24819,"name":"Gary Raymond","role":"Acastus","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i9dQF7Qay82YSUnqwJofYsKwKZ1.jpg"},{"id":69764,"name":"Laurence Naismith","role":"Argos","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fflpjxdTiOuwO0tsglyr9GKCtD2.jpg"},{"id":93163,"name":"Niall MacGinnis","role":"Zeus","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mUk1X9TYL2dl0uKfB2kwTCmGiDx.jpg"},{"id":30705,"name":"Michael Gwynn","role":"Hermes","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pyklvVKyfDM1JVD1LSVrIu5U05y.jpg"},{"id":89065,"name":"Douglas Wilmer","role":"Pelias","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/483bRvQxgQwo9ePT75v0Ojvhyex.jpg"},{"id":13331,"name":"Jack Gwillim","role":"Aeëtes","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sxi3CEhSnYIHljsXrCUvJ2cvrdV.jpg"},{"id":9907,"name":"Honor Blackman","role":"Hera","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2AGVWf7orxXvgcssUWdonX1yKvm.jpg"},{"id":96759,"name":"John Cairney","role":"Hylas","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1Pcbw5HYJCgyOZUgg22MqGjbIdV.jpg"},{"id":11840,"name":"Patrick Troughton","role":"Phineas","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hXbTZ7tcHHFE96TyUm6iAY8k5sY.jpg"},{"id":14823,"name":"Andrew Faulds","role":"Phalerus","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kQdTOUeLDxivFcmhJXJ6hv43f3k.jpg"},{"id":29909,"name":"Nigel Green","role":"Hercules","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ksK243NEx8QACBBSW3fV6j1B04l.jpg"},{"id":15693,"name":"John Crawford","role":"Polydeuces (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/82pqVVILPiC6GpjenmepSTjnOMB.jpg"},{"id":114645,"name":"Ferdinando Poggi","role":"Castor of Sparta (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wgmIC9xM5agpR1nVLoTeHTYU6CB.jpg"},{"id":120027,"name":"Ennio Antonelli","role":"Dmitrius, Drummer on Argo (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k2BB0lgezdOHfkwarQkFGW4hY3U.jpg"},{"id":1046594,"name":"Harold Bradley","role":"Guard in Palace (uncredited)"},{"id":2257706,"name":"Aldo Cristiani","role":"Lynceus (uncredited)"},{"id":3120026,"name":"Eva Haddon","role":"Medea (voice) (uncredited)"},{"id":2644740,"name":"Doug Robinson","role":"Eupaemus (uncredited)"},{"id":1232876,"name":"Davina Taylor","role":"Briseis (uncredited)"},{"id":1242611,"name":"Tim Turner","role":"Jason (voice) (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1RwoTvthcwywhxrjg1JvJNQYiE.jpg"},{"id":5887036,"name":"Bill Gudgeon","role":"Triton (uncredited)"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Gli Argonauti","overview":"Giasone si reca alla ricerca del Vello d'Oro, su ordine del re Pelia. Costui però trama contro di lui perché l'oracolo dice che Giasone stesso l'ucciderà. Il mitico eroe riesce comunque a compiere la sua missione, anche con l'aiuto degli dei e di Medea, figlia del re della Colchide. Impadronitosi del Vello, dopo aver ucciso l'Idra a sette teste, Giasone condurrà Medea con sé sulla via del ritorno.Liberamente ispirato al mito di Giasone, il film bada al sodo: quant'è bella l'avventura. Un capolavoro gli \"ingenui\" effetti speciali di Ray Harryhausen (con la lotta contro gli scheletri), una delizia la fotografia. Musiche di Bernard Herrmann. Un piccolo classico che vanta numerosi cultori."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Jason, a fearless sailor and explorer, returns to his home land of Thessaly after a long voyage to claim his rightful throne. He learns, however, that he must first find the magical Golden Fleece. To do so, he must embark on an epic quest fraught with fantastic monsters and terrible perils.","tagline":"The epic story that was destined to stand as a colossus of adventure!"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g7jpBMAU2D9qxmp5q8G8O8nRfLA.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xdefSJpYARFdW4jPhPsuvUlmt2M.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"enrichment":{"status":"ready","hasMissingEpisodeMetadata":false}}
